From: as7760 bring-up
Subject: [PATCH] board: t208xrdb: honour CONFIG_VID and CONFIG_PCI

board_early_init_r() calls adjust_vdd() and pci_init() unconditionally, so a
config without VID (no IR36021 regulator) or PCI fails to link.

--- a/board/nxp/t208xrdb/t208xrdb.c	2026-11-14 12:42:33.556902645 -0800
+++ b/board/nxp/t208xrdb/t208xrdb.c	2026-11-14 12:42:33.612902886 -0800
@@ -112,10 +112,14 @@
 	 * Adjust core voltage according to voltage ID
 	 * This function changes I2C mux to channel 2.
 	 */
+#ifdef CONFIG_VID
 	if (adjust_vdd(0))
 		printf("Warning: Adjusting core voltage failed.\n");
+#endif
 
+#ifdef CONFIG_PCI
 	pci_init();
+#endif
 
 	return 0;
 }
